OL,5,Ainjured, regional leader says
OL,6,
OL,7,FRail operator Adif says the incident
OL,8,Foccurred between a Renfe train and
OL,9,Fanother of the Iryo company, which
OL,10,Fcovers the Madrid to Seville route
